### Contracts  - Delete contract by ID
DELETE http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/Contracts(guid'8512e1ce-a990-4d90-b958-a5526c08a689')
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

### Products  - Get product by ID
GET http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/Products(ID=guid'76fef7ca-e92e-11ea-adc1-0242ac120002')?
    &$expand=Deliveries,Letters
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

###Products  - Create new Product
POST http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/Products
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Contract_ID": "2c0a48ae-e72b-4cc0-86af-7656260f2140",
    "ProductPackId": 100122,
    "CountryCode": "SA",
    "UoM": "Unit",
    "Deleted": 0
}

### Products  - Remove product by ID
DELETE http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/Products(ID=guid'7a8a46ad-ddbf-49be-81a6-bf8e46787700')
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

### Deliveries  - Get all Deliveries
GET http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/Deliveries
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

### Deliveries  - Remove delivery by ID
DELETE http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/Deliveries(ID=guid'9ce01dfd-4a45-4e33-890b-6c4beaeff320')
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

### Letters  - Get all Letters
GET http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/Letters
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

### Letters  - Remove Letter by ID
DELETE http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/Letters(ID=guid'5c90dc38-11f8-4c3f-8858-04acdbdff7b4')
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t




#############################
## TenderContracts Service ##
#############################

### TenderContracts  - Get with expand
GET http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/TenderContracts(ContractNumber='SA-19-612-1073-BLC-11')?
    &$expand=Products/Deliveries,Products/Letters,SellingCompany,Distributor,Institute
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

### TenderProducts  - Get tender product with expand
GET http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/TenderProducts(OfferID='SA-19-612-1073-BLC-11',Active=1,ProductCode=100036)
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

###TenderLetters  - Create new Letter. OFFERID and SKUCODE links it to a product
POST http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/TenderLetters
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "TenderID": "SA-19-612-1073",
    "OfferID": "SA-19-612-1073-BLC-11",
    "CountryCode": "SA",
    "InstituteId": 100155,
    "SkuCode": 100036,
    "createdAt": "/Date(1597968000000)/",
    "createdBy": "Artiom Sargesjan",
    "ACTIVE": 1,
    "ReasonForLetter": "Lorem ipsum ",
    "Quantity": 4,
    "Batch": null,
    "ManufacturingDate": null,
    "ExpiryDate": null,
    "ReturnDate": null,
    "ReturnedQuantity": 12,
    "UoM": "pack",
    "SNO": 5
}

###TenderLetters  - Get Letter by ID. 
GET http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/TenderLetters(OfferID='SA-19-612-1073-BLC-11',Active=1,SkuCode=100036,SNo=5)
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

###TenderDeliveries  - Get Delivery by ID. 
GET http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/TenderDeliveries(OfferID='AE-15-100-1012-BPH-16-A-R1-C1',Active=1,ProductCode=100045,SNo=1)
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

### TenderDeliveries  - Remove TenderDeliveries by ID
DELETE http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/TenderDeliveries(OfferID='AE-15-100-1012-BPH-16-A-R1-C1',Active=1,ProductCode=100045,SNo=1)
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

